    <meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="description" content="ESMA regulates investment services and crowdfunding with a strong focus on enhancing investor protection in the EU. ESMA is committed to ensuring that investment firms treat their customers in a fair and transparent way, that investors are given clear and relevant information to be able to make informed investment decisions and that investors are provided with products matching their needs and investment objectives." />
